        "id": 1087037
      },
      "writtenOn": "2021-02-10T18:55:50Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "each bit will mean a specific channel.\nexample bit 1 - left\nbit 2 - right channel\nbit 3 - front left\nbit 4 - front right\nbit 5 - subwoofer\n\nSo if we enable bits 1 and 2, we will send left and right channels in the outgoing over-the-air packet, in this order\n\n\nif we enable bits 1,2,5, then we will send left, right and subwoofer.\n\n\n\"List of Audio Locations\" is part of specification that is not public yet.",
      "parentUuid": "6218b069_3a7bdb78",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 69,
        "startChar": 29,
        "endLine": 69,
        "endChar": 69
      },
      "revId": "62bb4b9627c50c000af1ba21dc48c8badfa19a78",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "a141f621_f968a56b",
        "filename": "bluetooth/audio/2.1/types.hal",
